00:56:23.050 --> 00:56:27.550
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Torey Malatia, who told me back when he first hired me--
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样感谢我们节目的联合创始人托瑞·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia），他在最初雇用我时告诉我——

00:56:27.550 --> 00:56:38.230
<v Torey Malatia>You have the ability to walk around work, perhaps show up at one point, and perhaps like go away for a little while and turn invisible, and then come back and listen to what they say about you.
<v Torey Malatia>你拥有在工作中四处走动的能力，或许，在某个时刻出现，或许消失一会儿并隐身，然后再回来听听他们是怎么评价你的。

00:56:38.230 --> 00:56:43.230
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
